# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored; never commit real keys.
# Wrangler reads .env for local dev and tests (a .dev.vars file, if present,
# takes precedence). The deploy scripts upload only SIFTING_API_KEY and
# LSE_API_KEY from it, refuse any other key or an empty value, and keep the
# deployed value of any key left commented out.
# Only providers listed in PROVIDER_ORDER (wrangler.jsonc vars, default
# sifting,lse) need a key. Uncomment a line and set its value to use it.
# LSE_API_KEY=
# SIFTING_API_KEY=
